  "merger_description": "Motorola Solutions, Inc. (**MSI**), through its subsidiary Motorola Solutions Finance EMEA Limited (**MSF EMEA**), proposes to acquire all of the issued and outstanding shares of D-Fend Solutions AD Ltd. (**D-Fend Solutions**) (the **Acquisition**). Upon completion, D-Fend Solutions will become a wholly owned indirect subsidiary of MSI.\n\nMSI is a US\u2011domiciled company that supplies mission\u2011critical communications, video security and access control, and command centre software products and solutions for public safety, government (including defence), and enterprise customers. MSF EMEA is the holding entity for MSI's operating subsidiaries in the UK, EU, Israel, and Norway.\n\nD\u2011Fend Solutions is an Israel\u2011based technology company specialising in counter\u2011unmanned aircraft system (C\u2011UAS) technology. D\u2011Fend Solutions supplies devices that detect, identify and mitigate unauthorised drones, including through radio frequency, radar and optical detection technologies. Its products are supplied primarily to public safety and critical infrastructure customers.",
